<title>FRANCE: Suez Lyonnaise unit in property sale talks.</title>
<headline>Suez Lyonnaise unit in property sale talks.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>ISM, a subsidiary of Credisuez, confirmed on Tuesday it has opened negotiations for the sale of its tourist and business service apartments grouped under the Orion brand.</p>
<p>Credisuez is the property arm of utility group Suez Lyonnaise des Eaux.</p>
</text>
